WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:07.106
♪ Penny Lane, there is a barber
showing photographs ♪

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.843
♪ Of every head
he's had the pleasure to know ♪

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:15.148
♪ And all the people
that come and go ♪

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.951
♪ Stop and say, "Hello" ♪

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:24.123
♪ On the corner is a banker
with a motorcar ♪

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:28.328
♪ The little children laugh
at him behind his back ♪

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.464
♪ And the banker
never wears a Mac ♪

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:35.134
♪ In the pouring rain ♪

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.337
♪ Very strange ♪

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:42.909
♪ Penny Lane is in my ears
and in my eyes ♪

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:51.150
♪ Wet beneath
the blue suburban skies ♪

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:54.320
♪ I sit and meanwhile back ♪

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:57.990
♪ In Penny Lane there is
a fireman with an hourglass ♪

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.594
♪ And in his pocket
is a portrait of the Queen ♪

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.899
♪ He likes to keep
his fire engine clean ♪

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.069
♪ It's a clean machine ♪

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.104
[BELL CLANGING]

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.240
[TRUMPET SOLO]

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:34.127
♪ Penny Lane is in my ears
and in my eyes ♪

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:41.700
♪ A four of fish
and finger pies ♪

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:44.870
♪ In summer, meanwhile back ♪

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.408
♪ Behind the shelter in
the middle of the roundabout ♪

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:52.778
♪ A pretty nurse is selling
poppies from a tray ♪

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:57.383
♪ And though she feels
as if she's in a play ♪

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.719
♪ She is anyway ♪

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:05.424
♪ Penny Lane, the barber
shaves another customer ♪

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.362
♪ We see the banker sitting
waiting for a trim ♪

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:13.600
♪ And then,
the fireman rushes in ♪

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.635
♪ From the pouring rain ♪

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:18.738
♪ Very strange ♪

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:25.145
♪ Penny Lane is in my ears
and in my eyes ♪

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:32.184
♪ There beneath
the blue suburban skies ♪

